# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Get a key by registering an application at https://unsplash.com/developers
# Only the ACCESS key is needed. The Secret Key is for OAuth user-authorisation
# flows and must NOT be put here.
#
# WARNING: Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the built bundle. This key will be
# readable by anyone who inspects the packed extension. That is inherent to
# client-side apps — never put a key here that you would mind being public.
# Leave it empty and the extension silently uses Bing instead.
VITE_UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=
